 included activities without planning a purchase.","short_summary":"Pair a winter lights walk with a free historic-house open house.","evidence_claim":"H.A.R.D. lists Holiday Lights as a free event with mansion lighting, activities, an open house, and hot chocolate.","source_url":"https://www.haywardrec.org/2058/Special-Events","source_title":"Special Events","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Wednesday, December 2, 2026, 5:30–7:30 p.m. at McConaghy House, 18701 Hesperian Boulevard, Hayward.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
